  {
   "id": "b1_16",
   "start": 125.73,
   "end": 140.19,
   "line": "After an accident, investigators feed those numbers into a computer and rebuild the flight as an animation, matched to the sounds from the cockpit. They can watch exactly where the plane went, what the controls did, and what the crew heard, moment by moment.",
   "scene": "The numbers become a replay of the flight",
